OL,3,AMultiple flights in Europe hit by
OL,4,A'malicious hoax threats', UK transport
OL,5,Asecretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across Europe have been
OL,8,Fimpacted by bomb threats for the second
OL,9,Ftime this week
OL,11,FAt least 18 flights have reported
OL,12,Fthreats - see a recap here
OL,14,FHeidi Alexander, the UK transport
OL,15,Fsecretary, describes them as "malicious
OL,16,Fhoax threats"
OL,18,FAirport authorities in Rome say they
OL,19,Freceived a threat on email from a group
OL,20,Fcalled "Fighters of the Male State"
OL,21,Fclaiming to be targeting a "feminist
OL,22,Fregime"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
